🧪 Troubleshooting

| Issue                      | Solution                                                        |
| -------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Microphone not working     | Check permissions and connection                                |
| "Nova" not recognized      | Ensure ambient noise is low or increase sensitivity             |
| No audio output            | Confirm speaker configuration and volume                        |
| API Key errors             | Validate format and existence in `settings.json`                |
| PyQt window not displaying | Ensure `PyQt5` is properly installed and you're using `main.py` |


